---- what will not do
timeunit a str => TypeError must be real number, not str
five => TypeError Profiler() takes at most 4 arguments (5 given)
something else => TypeError Profiler() got an unexpected keyword argument 'other'
by name => Profiler
will not say whether it is true => ZeroDivisionError division by zero
enable(1, 2, 3) => TypeError enable() takes at most 2 arguments (3 given)
enable(other=1) => TypeError enable() got an unexpected keyword argument 'other'
disable(1) => TypeError Profiler.disable() takes no arguments (1 given)
clear(1) => TypeError Profiler.clear() takes no arguments (1 given)
getstats(1) => TypeError getstats() takes no arguments
disable() when it is not enabled => None
getstats() of nothing => []
Profiler.x = 1 => TypeError cannot set 'x' attribute of immutable type '_lsprof.Profiler'
an attribute => AttributeError '_lsprof.Profiler' object has no attribute 'x' and no __dict__ for setting new attributes
_pystart_callback() => TypeError _pystart_callback expected 2 arguments, got 0
_ccall_callback(1, 2, 3) => TypeError _ccall_callback expected 4 arguments, got 3
made and not initialized => [[], None, None]
initialized twice => [None, []]
two at once => ValueError tool 2 is already in use
the same one twice => ValueError tool 2 is already in use
cProfile
None None
and then the other => [None, None]
something else has its place => ValueError tool 2 is already in use
